{"2866750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Carrier", "steam_appid": 2866750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Void Carrier, you play as a Blobsquare. Because you have no limbs (or muscles) you must inject yourself with various questionable substances in order to move. If you run out, tough luck! You can't move anymore. This game is a difficult puzzle game with many worlds that each have their own gimmicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many worlds with new gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world map to explore and collect stars by beating levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use moves to slide and get stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866750/extras/096868e2be50c0bcdd4c1b913c07d332.poster.avif?t=1756738829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866750/extras/096868e2be50c0bcdd4c1b913c07d332.webm?t=1756738829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866750/extras/5bbf54c5eef39b3cd0bcc5eb92981f2f.poster.avif?t=1756738829\" width=560 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866750/extras/5bbf54c5eef39b3cd0bcc5eb92981f2